abstract: >-
  Research software accompanying the paper "Co-Location Similarity Search
  with Semantic Constraints". It extends PathSim for co-location similarity
  search in spatial heterogeneous information networks by relaxing exact
  matches at spatial intermediate nodes while preserving PathSim's round-trip
  semantics. The implementation includes an exact edge-decomposition
  realization and a scalable H3 grid-based connectivity approximation, together with
  weighted variants and experimental evaluation code.

